 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nSuministros del Norte SL                                  MASTER SERVICES\n                                                          AGREEMENT\nCalle Mayor 15, 28001 Madrid, Spain\nCIF/NIF: ESB91649001\n\nFROM                                                      FACTURAR A\n\nSuministros del Norte SL                                  Talleres Mediterráneo SA\nCalle Mayor 15                                            Calle Mayor 15\n28001 Madrid                                              46001 Valencia\nSpain                                                     Spain\nVAT: ESB91649001\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 15/03/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Suministros del Norte SL, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15, Madrid\n(\"Party A\"), and Talleres Mediterráneo SA, with its registered office at Calle Mayor 15, Valencia\n(\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A  Suministros del Norte SL / Carlos García\n Party B  Talleres Mediterráneo SA / Lucía Fernández\n Date     15/03/2026",
